sentences.l:
“O woman, there is no way to interpret the dream
by turning it another way, since indeed to you Odysseus himself
has shown how he will bring it to pass;

for now I shall set down a contest,
the axes, which he in his own halls
used to set up in a row, like ship-props, all twelve;

for before to you many-wiled Odysseus will come here,
before these men, handling this well-polished bow,
string the string and shoot through the iron.”
